sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant A as Assistant (obeys everything)
    participant G as Gateway
    participant D as Hardened desk
    participant L as Audit log
    A->>G: read INBOX-1
    G->>D: read (reader key, T1 ceiling)
    D-->>A: ticket text, with a planted instruction
    D->>L: ok, INBOX-1
    A->>G: read CUST-7 (as the ticket says)
    G->>D: read
    D-->>A: "document not found" (same as a missing id)
    D->>L: denied, CUST-7
    A->>G: send_report to an outside address
    G->>D: send_report
    D-->>A: refused, the desk never sends
    D->>L: refused, send_report
    A->>G: propose_change RB-1, then approve it
    G->>D: propose_change
    D-->>A: pending proposal with a diff
    D->>L: queued, RB-1
    G->>D: approve (same key)
    D-->>A: refused, a key cannot approve its own proposal
    D->>L: refused, approve
